  "notes": "Fixture for init.sh. A complete harness that keeps its own file names and its own words: nothing canonical exists at this root. scope.completionGate needs its own synonym entry even though instructions.definitionOfDone has the same one - the two checks are not linked, because their needle sets genuinely differ."
}
